I will report accidents promptly so that assistance and any applicable insurance procedure can be arranged. The gym will provide information about applicable sports insurance, coverage and claim procedures. Acknowledging activity risks does not exclude or limit responsibility that cannot lawfully be excluded, including responsibility for negligent or unsafe conduct, and does not waive my legal rights.

